nit NCT Dream. Born and raised in Jilin, Renjun started training in South Korea under SM Entertainment in 2015. He made his debut in 2016 with NCT, which went on to achieve commercial success and become an influential K-pop act. He released his first extended play (EP), Echoes Between Us, in 2026; one of its tracks, \"Halo\", entered the top 10 on the TME Uni Chart.","title":"Renjun","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Renjun"}},"Q624159":{"id":"Q624159","name":"Kim Jang-hoon","ko":"김장훈","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1967-08-14","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"1991","agencies":[],"groups":[],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/concert_kim/","x":"https://x.com/ConcertKim","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrN0o_aXofgjNGIMXM1Lsxw","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/a34502f8-dbf5-48ad-9799-fe0dc38dfb0b"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/LG%EC%A0%84%EC%9E%90%2C_%ED%95%9C%EB%A5%98%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C_%EC%A4%91%EA%B5%AD_3D_TV_%EC%8B%9C%EC%9E%A5_%EA%B3%B5%EB%9E%B5_%EA%B0%95%ED%99%94_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:LG%EC%A0%84%EC%9E%90,_%ED%95%9C%EB%A5%98%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C_%EC%A4%91%EA%B5%AD_3D_TV_%EC%8B%9C%EC%9E%A5_%EA%B3%B5%EB%9E%B5_%EA%B0%95%ED%99%94_(cropped).jpg","author":"LG전자","license":"CC BY 2.0"},"bio":{"text":"Kim Jang-hoon is a South Korean singer, known for his rock ballads.","title":"Kim Jang-hoon","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_Jang-hoon"}},"Q62984351":{"id":"Q62984351","name":"Im Jiyeon","ko":"임지연","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Yuki"],"birth":"2002-01-30","death":"","birthplace":"South Korea","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{